+- **Evidence (reviewer@1 journal, run events):** the capture header reads `seed-work=7 files +228/-23 | loop-churn=3 files +3/-2` — the seed-mandated `planner.md` reword (+1/−1) was classified as loop churn (counts only). The reviewer journaled: *"a seed acceptance criterion was reviewable only because I re-read the file with tools."*
